Adapt readline callbacks and history to OpenBSD libedit's exposed API.
Refresh the prompt without mutating the editor's private line buffer.

Index: contrib/epee/src/readline_buffer.cpp
--- contrib/epee/src/readline_buffer.cpp.orig
